GAMS Showcases

The Tilemap Project configuration is adapted from the Apache-2.0 GAMS
Tilemap Views Project (https://github.com/kkgams/view.tilemap).
The courtyard map and atlas are original showcase assets under Apache-2.0.
Referenced GAMS Project Units are downloaded separately and retain their own terms.

The Aseprite, SQL, and Nodegraph Project configurations are adapted from
Apache-2.0 GAMS Projects in kkgams/view.image, kkgams/view.sql, and
kkgams/view.ng. The Firefly sprite, item dataset, and tree workflow are
original showcase content under Apache-2.0.
